{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43174","headline":"江南曲 · 李叔卿","name":"江南曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湖上女，江南花，无双越女春浣纱。\n风似箭，月如弦，少年吴儿晓进船。\n郗家子弟谢家郎，乌巾白袷紫香囊。\n菱歌思欲绝，楚舞断人肠。\n歌舞未终涕双陨，旧宫坡陁才嶙隐。\n西山暮雨过江来，北渚春云沿海尽。\n渡口水流缓，妾归宵剩迟。\n含情爲君再理曲，月华照出澄江时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李叔卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43174.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43174","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}